										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Film material</p>
<p>The core of membrane technology is membranes. In general, the chemical properties and structure of the membrane have a decisive influence on the properties of the membrane separation. Therefore, it is required that the membrane material should have good film forming properties, chemical stability, resistance to acids, alkalis, oxides, and microorganisms.</p>
